#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/dynamic_text.rst:5
msgid "Dynamic text"
msgstr "动态文本"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/dynamic_text.rst:7
msgid ""
"The dynamic text field is an object that displays a text that is coming from"
" a variable value. The text value is changing with the variable is changed, "
"editing the part is not necessary to change the text content."
msgstr "动态文本字段是一种显示来自变量值的文本的对象。文本值会随变量的变化而变化，无需编辑部件即可更改文本内容。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/dynamic_text.rst:12
msgid "Create dynamic text"
msgstr "创建动态文本"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/dynamic_text.rst:14
msgid "The text field can only be added to `workspace`_ from `toolbar`_."
msgstr "文本字段只能从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 添加到 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/dynamic_text.rst:16
msgid ""
"Select the icon |icon_dynamic_text| from `toolbar`_ to add a dynamic text "
"field."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 中选择图标 |icon_dynamic_text| 以添加动态文本字段。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/dynamic_text.rst:19
msgid "icon_dynamic_text"
msgstr "动态文本图标"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/dynamic_text.rst:17
msgid "Click the positional point from the text field in the `workspace`_."
msgstr "在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中单击文本字段的放置点。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/dynamic_text.rst:23
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Parts**."
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 未显示，可以从 **Settings > Display > Parts** 中显示。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/dynamic_text.rst:26
msgid "Dynamic text properties"
msgstr "动态文本属性"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/dynamic_text.rst:28
msgid ""
"Element part properties can be displayed from `information panel`_ when the "
"part is selected."
msgstr "选中部件后，可以从 `信息面板 <information panel_>`_ 显示元件部件属性。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/dynamic_text.rst:33
msgid ""
"If the `information panel`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from "
"**Settings > Display > Information**."
msgstr ""
"如果 `信息面板 <information panel_>`_ 未显示，可以从 **Settings > Display > Information**"
" 中显示。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/dynamic_text.rst:38
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech dynamic text field part from element"
msgstr "图：元件中的 QElectroTech 动态文本字段部件"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/dynamic_text.rst:40
msgid "QElectroTech allows customizing different text properties:"
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许自定义不同的文本属性："

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/dynamic_text.rst
msgid "Placement"
msgstr "放置"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/dynamic_text.rst
msgid "Position"
msgstr "位置"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/dynamic_text.rst:46
msgid "The dynamic text coordinates (x, y) can be defined."
msgstr "可以定义动态文本的坐标 (x, y)。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/dynamic_text.rst
msgid "Rotation"
msgstr "旋转"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/dynamic_text.rst:50
msgid ""
"The text display angle can be defined in the range of 0 to 360 degrees."
msgstr "文本显示角度可在 0 到 360 度范围内设置。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/dynamic_text.rst
msgid "Frame"
msgstr "边框"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/dynamic_text.rst:54
msgid ""
"The possibility to display the text inside a rectangle frame is provided."
msgstr "可以在矩形边框内显示文本。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/dynamic_text.rst
msgid "Alignment"
msgstr "对齐"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/dynamic_text.rst:58
msgid ""
"The text position inside the frame can be defined. Left, center or right and"
" top, middle or bottom."
msgstr "可以定义文本在边框内的位置：左、中或右，以及上、中或下。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/dynamic_text.rst
msgid "Content"
msgstr "内容"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/dynamic_text.rst
msgid "Source"
msgstr "来源"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/dynamic_text.rst:64
msgid ""
"The source content can be user text (similar to static text), element "
"information parameter or composite text."
msgstr "源内容可以是用户文本（类似于静态文本）、元件信息参数或复合文本。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/dynamic_text.rst
msgid "Size"
msgstr "大小"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/dynamic_text.rst:68
msgid "The text size can be defined."
msgstr "可以设置文本大小。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/dynamic_text.rst
msgid "Color"
msgstr "颜色"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/dynamic_text.rst:72
msgid "The text color can be chosen from RGB color code database."
msgstr "文本颜色可以从 RGB 颜色代码数据库中选择。"
